Package: cdzoo
Title: A Multi-Backend Benchmark Harness and Recommender for Causal
    Discovery
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Max", "Moldovan", , "max.moldovan@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9680-8474"))
Description: Provides a single typed interface over a curated portfolio of
    causal-structure-discovery algorithms drawn from several R and Python
    back-ends, together with a structural-causal-model scenario grid, fair
    graph-recovery metrics, and an evidence-routed recommender that inspects
    a data set and suggests a discovery method suited to its characteristics.
    Every back-end is optional and loaded lazily only when used, so the
    harness, the scenario grid, the metrics, and the recommender's routing
    logic all run with no suggested package installed.
